## Cross-Reference Guidelines

### When to Update llms.txt

- Adding new documentation file
- Adding new section to existing file
- Changing file names or locations
- Adding new concepts or patterns

### When to Update llms-full.txt

- Major content additions
- New architecture diagrams
- Significant pattern documentation
- Comprehensive changes

### Cross-Reference Format

```markdown
See also: [PATTERNS.md](docs/PATTERNS.md#pattern-1-typed-message-protocol)
```

