## Templates

### New Documentation Section

```markdown
## Section Title

> Brief description

### Subsection

| Column 1 | Column 2 |
|----------|----------|
| Value | Description |

**Source**: [file.rs](https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/main/path/file.rs)
```

### New Mermaid Diagram

```markdown
## Diagram Title

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Component<br/>(path/file.rs)
    participant B as Component<br/>(path/file.rs)
    A->>B: message
    B-->>A: response
```
```

### New Pattern Entry

```markdown
## Pattern N: Pattern Name

### Problem
Description of the problem being solved.

### Solution
```rust
// codex-rs/path/to/file.rs
// Code example
```

### Benefits
- Benefit 1
- Benefit 2
```

